  "identifier": "gow-ragnarok-fraekni-guide-2026",
  "headline": "Fraekni the Zealous guide (God of War Ragnarok): consistent punishes vs rushes and sweep chains",
  "description": "Fraekni punishes greedy strings. Fix your dodge angle for unblockables and take only end-of-chain confirms for a stable clear.",
  "keywords": [
    "fraekni the zealous guide",
    "berserker",
    "svartalfheim",
    "unblockable rush",
    "strategy"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\n- unblockable rush catches panic dodges\n- getting greedy into sweep chains\n\n2) Prep\n- two short runics\n- commit to one defense loop (parry-first or evade-first)\n\n3) Fixed plan\n1) hold mid-range; dodge unblockable rush laterally to create back hits\n2) punish only at the end of sweep chains\n3) if hit, disengage and reset spacing\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- after unblockable rush recovery\n- chain follow-through end\n- big swing landing\n\nRelated: use the all-Berserkers index for gravestone navigation.",
